# changelog-helper

This repo ships the `changelog-helper` Claude Code plugin. The manifest is
`.claude-plugin/plugin.json`; the only skill is `skills/changelog-entry/`.

- Test: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`
- Bump `version` in `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` for any user-visible change.
- Keep the skill's script standard-library only.
- For how the skill, script and marketplace entry fit together, see
  docs/architecture.md before changing any of them.
- Changelog style rules are in docs/style.md.
